T* (Option Care without recourse against the non-defaulting sponsor if either party fails to fund. Furthermore, while Parent is subject) Tj
T* (to a heightened 'best efforts' obligation for state healthcare and pharmacy licensing across Target's 86 pharmacies and 187) Tj
T* (ambulatory infusion suites, antitrust clearance under the HSR Act is governed solely by a mutual 'reasonable best efforts') Tj
T* (standard. Because Option Care sourced 68% of its supplies from four wholesale distributors in 2025 and 57% from three in H1) Tj
T* (2026, combining McKesson's distribution scale with Target's downstream network creates vertical foreclosure scrutiny that the) Tj
T* (Buyer Consortium is not contractually bound to resolve through burdensome divestitures under a reasonable best efforts) Tj
